cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article whose screening protocol it implements."
title: "OSLDMolLib"
abstract: >-
  Automated, queue-driven pipeline for screening candidate molecules of electrically pumped
  organic lasers. It optimises the relevant electronic states (S0, S1, T1, cation and anion)
  with Gaussian 16, collects their vertical absorptions and the S1 excited-state absorption
  obtained with Multiwfn, and renders one combined absorption, emission, polaron and triplet
  spectrum per molecule.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Pb-207"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pb-207/OSLDMolLib"
date-released: "2026-09-11"
references:
